# Build context for MOTHER/Dockerfile and GUI/Dockerfile is the repository root.
# Whitelist only what the images need; everything else (data/, .env files, tests, venvs, node_modules) stays out.
*
!MOTHER/requirements.txt
!MOTHER/mother/
!MOTHER/config/
!MOTHER/web/
!config/
!data/nasa/
!GUI/
GUI/node_modules
GUI/dist
GUI/Dockerfile
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
